d":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001","quote":"謝裕字景仁，朗弟允之子、而晦從父也。名與宋武帝諱同，故以字行。允字令度，位宣城內史。景仁幼爲從祖安所知，始爲前軍行參軍，會稽王世子元顯嬖人張法順權傾一時，內外無不造門，唯景仁不至，年三十而方爲著作佐郎。桓玄誅元顯，見景仁，謂四坐曰：「司馬庶人父子雲何不敗，遂令謝景仁三十而方佐著作郎。」玄建楚臺，以補黃門侍郎。及篡位，領驍騎將軍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0004","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0003","assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-xie-support-yun-younger-brother-lang","scope":"完整原段明載關係；本父系接合屬可撤回編者判讀，非新增原文明載父子。","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/南史/卷19"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-079","source_id":"s-jinshu-079-xielang-family","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:p003","quote":"朗字長度。父據，早卒。朗善言玄理，文義豔發，名亞于玄。總角時，病新起，體甚贏，未堪勞，于叔父安前與沙門支遁朗論，遂至相苦。其母王氏再遣信令還，安欲留，使竟論，王氏因出云：「新婦少遭艱難，一生所寄惟在此兒。」遂流涕攜朗去。安謂坐客曰：「家嫂辭情慷慨，恨不使朝士見之。」朗終於東陽太守。","assertion_id":"a-jinshu079-xie-006","scope":"完整原段明載關係；本父系接合屬可撤回編者判讀，非新增原文明載父子。","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7079&oldid=2645985"}]},"assembly_id":"family-chenjun-xie-lang","root_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy","status":"editorial_preferred","human_reviewed":false},"assembled_children":[{"person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB","representative_source_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB","source_person_ids":["aa6_83c_juy_ABB"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AB","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_sibling","sibling_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABA","sibling_assertion_id":"a-songshu052-xie-support-chun-younger-brother-jingren","sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-songshu052-xie-support-jingren-father-yun","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"原文明示具名兄弟及其中一人之父；同父為可撤回的近系編者首選，未獨立明載，不造另一條literal父子。","references":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-current-rendered-xiejingren-near-family","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002","quote":"景仁弟純字景懋，初為劉毅豫州別駕。毅鎮江陵，以為衞軍長史、南平相。王鎮惡率軍襲毅，已至城下，時毅疾病，佐吏皆入參承。純參承畢，已出，聞兵至，馳還入府。左右引車欲還外解，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲何之！」乃入。及毅兵敗眾散，時已暗夜，司馬毛脩之謂純曰：「君但隨僕。」純不從，扶兩人出，火光中為人所殺。純孫沈，太宗泰始初，為巴陵王休若衞軍錄事參軍、山陰令，坐事誅。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002:m0001","assertion_id":"a-songshu052-xie-support-chun-younger-brother-jingren","scope":"完整原段明載關係；本父系接合屬可撤回編者判讀，非新增原文明載父子。","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/宋書/卷52"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-current-rendered-xiejingren-near-family","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p001","quote":"謝景仁，陳郡陽夏人，衞將軍晦從叔父也。名與高祖同諱，故稱字。祖據，太傅安第二弟。父允，宣城內史。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p001:m0001","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p001:m0006","assertion_id":"a-songshu052-xie-support-jingren-father-yun","scope":"完整原段明載關係；本父系接合屬可撤回編者判讀，非新增原文明載父子。","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/宋書/卷52"}]},"assembly_id":"family-chenjun-xie-lang","root_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy","status":"editorial_preferred","human_reviewed":false},{"person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABC","representative_source_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABC","source_person_ids":["aa6_83c_juy_ABC"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AB","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_sibling_chain","sibling_person_ids":["aa6_83c_juy_ABB","aa6_83c_juy_ABA"],"sibling_assertion_ids":["a-songshu052-xie-support-shu-elder-brother-chun","a-songshu052-xie-support-chun-younger-brother-jingren"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-songshu052-xie-support-jingren-father-yun","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"述隨兄純，純為景仁弟，景仁父允；透過明確中介純作同父近系首選，不把述誤稱景仁原文明言之弟。","references":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-current-rendered-xiejingren-near-family","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003","quote":"述字景先，少有志行，隨兄純在江陵。純遇害，述奉純喪還都。行至西塞，值暴風，純喪舫流漂，不知所在，述乘小船尋求之。經純妻庾舫過，庾遣人謂述曰：「喪舫存沒，已應有在，風波如此，豈可小船所冒？小郎去必無及，寧可存亡俱盡邪。」述號泣答曰：「若安全至岸，當須營理。如其已致意外，述亦無心獨存。」因冒浪而進，見純喪幾沒，述號叫呼天，幸而獲免，咸以為精誠所致也。高祖聞而嘉之，及臨豫州，諷中正以述為主簿，甚被知器。景仁愛其第三弟甝而憎述，嘗設饌請高祖，希命甝豫坐，而高祖召述。述知非景仁夙意，又慮高祖命之，請急不從。高祖馳遣呼述，須至乃歡。及景仁有疾，述盡心營視，湯藥飲食，必嘗而後進，不解帶、不盥櫛者累旬，景仁深懷感愧。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003:m0001","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003:m0003","assertion_id":"a-songshu052-xie-support-shu-elder-brother-chun","scope":"完整原段明載關係；本父系接合屬可撤回編者判讀，非新增原文明載父子。","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/宋書/卷52"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-current-rendered-xiejingren-near-family","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002","quote":"景仁弟純字景懋，初為劉毅豫州別駕。毅鎮江陵，以為衞軍長史、南平相。王鎮惡率軍襲毅，已至城下，時毅疾病，佐吏皆入參承。純參承畢，已出，聞兵至，馳還入府。左右引車欲還外解，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲何之！」乃入。及毅兵敗眾散，時已暗夜，司馬毛脩之謂純曰：「君但隨僕。」純不從，扶兩人出，火光中為人所殺。純孫沈，太宗泰始初，為巴陵王休若衞軍錄事參軍、山陰令，坐事誅。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p002:m0001","assertion_id":"a-songshu052-xie-support-chun-younger-brother-jingren","scope":"完整原段明載關係；本父系接合屬可撤回編者判讀，非新增原文明載父子。","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/宋書/卷52"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-current-rendered-xiejingren-near-family","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p001","quote"